title: "Delete a project API key"
icon: x
description: "Delete a project API key: revokeProjectApiKey in the TypeScript, Python and Rust clients."
---

`DELETE /v1/projects/{projectId}/api-keys/{apiKeyId}`

Revokes the identified key on the selected project and returns its revoked metadata. Repeating the deletion returns the same revokedAt value. This operation does not rotate the key or return a replacement secret. Supply the required Idempotency-Key header.

<Tabs>
<Tab title="TypeScript">
```typescript TypeScript
photon.projects.revokeProjectApiKey(input: RevokeProjectApiKeyInput, options?: RequestOptions): Promise<RevokeProjectApiKeyOutput>
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Python">
```python Python
photon.projects.revoke_project_api_key(input: RevokeProjectApiKeyInput) -> models.ProjectApiKeyResponse
```
</Tab>
<Tab title="Rust">
```rust Rust
client.revoke_project_api_key(idempotency_key: String, api_key_id: String, project_id: String).await -> Result<ResponseValue<types::ProjectApiKeyResponse>, Error<RevokeProjectApiKeyError>>
```
</Tab>
</Tabs>

<RequestExample>
```typescript TypeScript
import { Photon } from "@photon-ai/api";

const photon = new Photon({
  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${process.env.PHOTON_API_TOKEN}` },
});
const result = await photon.projects.revokeProjectApiKey({
  path: {
    apiKeyId: "apiKeyId",
    projectId: "projectId",
  },
  headers: {
    idempotencyKey: "idempotencyKey",
  },
});
```

```python Python
import os

from photon_api import Photon
from photon_api.rpc_generated import RevokeProjectApiKeyInput

photon = Photon(headers={"Authorization": f"Bearer {os.environ['PHOTON_API_TOKEN']}"})
result = photon.projects.revoke_project_api_key(
    RevokeProjectApiKeyInput.model_validate({
        "path": {
            "apiKeyId": "apiKeyId",
            "projectId": "projectId",
        },
        "headers": {
            "Idempotency-Key": "idempotencyKey",
        },
    })
)
```

```rust Rust
use photon_ai_api::{Credential, PhotonClientBuilder, SecretString};

let token = std::env::var("PHOTON_API_TOKEN")?;
let client = PhotonClientBuilder::new()
    .credential("accountServiceKey", Credential::Bearer(SecretString::from(token)))
    .build()?;
let result = client
    .revoke_project_api_key(
        "idempotencyKey".to_owned(),
        "apiKeyId".to_owned(),
        "projectId".to_owned(),
    )
    .await
    .map_err(|error| format!("{error:?}"))?
    .into_inner();
```

</RequestExample>

